💭 Byte-oriented string helpers. 🔍 returns byte offsets, so slicing has to be
💭 byte-based too (🔪 on 🔡 slices graphemes and would drift on non-ASCII input).
🌍 🐇 🧰 🍇
  📗 Substring by byte offset and byte length. 📗
  🐇❗️ ✂️ s 🔡 from 🔢 length 🔢 ➡️ 🔡 🍇
    ↪️ length ◀️🙌 0 🍇
      ↩️ 🔤🔤
    🍉
    ↪️ 🔡 🔪 📇 s❗️ from length❗️❗️ ➡️ out 🍇
      ↩️ out
    🍉
    ↩️ 🔤🔤
  🍉

  📗 Everything after the first *skip* bytes. 📗
  🐇❗️ 🦶 s 🔡 skip 🔢 ➡️ 🔡 🍇
    ↩️ ✂️🐇🧰 s skip 📐 s❗️ ➖ skip❗️
  🍉

  📗 Split on the first occurrence of *sep*. Returns one or two parts. 📗
  🐇❗️ ✌️ s 🔡 sep 🔡 ➡️ 🍨🐚🔡🍆 🍇
    ↪️ 🔍 s sep❗️ ➡️ index 🍇
      ↩️ 🍿 ✂️🐇🧰 s 0 index❗️ 🦶🐇🧰 s index ➕ 📐 sep❗️❗️ 🍆
    🍉
    ↩️ 🍿 s 🍆
  🍉

  📗 Replace every occurrence of *find* with *with*. 📗
  🐇❗️ 🔄 s 🔡 find 🔡 with 🔡 ➡️ 🔡 🍇
    ↩️ 🆕🔡 🔫 s find❗️ with❗️
  🍉

  📗 Whether *b* is ASCII whitespace (space, tab, CR, LF). 📗
  🐇❗️ 💨 b 💧 ➡️ 👌 🍇
    ↩️ b 🙌 32 👐 b 🙌 9 👐 b 🙌 10 👐 b 🙌 13
  🍉

  📗
    Trims ASCII whitespace from both ends. The stdlib 🔧 cuts a trailing
    multi-byte character down to its first byte, so Grapevine uses this instead.
  📗
  🐇❗️ 🧽 s 🔡 ➡️ 🔡 🍇
    📇 s❗️ ➡️ data
    0 ➡️ 🖍🆕start
    📏 data❓ ➡️ 🖍🆕stop
    👍 ➡️ 🖍🆕scanning
    🔁 scanning 🍇
      ↪️ start ◀️ stop 🍇
        ↪️ 💨🐇🧰 🐽 data start❗️❗️ 🍇
          start ➕ 1 ➡️ 🖍start
        🍉
        🙅 🍇
          👎 ➡️ 🖍scanning
        🍉
      🍉
      🙅 🍇
        👎 ➡️ 🖍scanning
      🍉
    🍉
    👍 ➡️ 🖍scanning
    🔁 scanning 🍇
      ↪️ stop ▶️ start 🍇
        ↪️ 💨🐇🧰 🐽 data stop ➖ 1❗️❗️ 🍇
          stop ➖ 1 ➡️ 🖍stop
        🍉
        🙅 🍇
          👎 ➡️ 🖍scanning
        🍉
      🍉
      🙅 🍇
        👎 ➡️ 🖍scanning
      🍉
    🍉
    ↩️ ✂️🐇🧰 s start stop ➖ start❗️
  🍉

  📗 Split a URL path into its non-empty segments. 📗
  🐇❗️ 🧶 path 🔡 ➡️ 🍨🐚🔡🍆 🍇
    🆕🍨🐚🔡🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕segments
    🔂 part 🔫 path 🔤/🔤❗️ 🍇
      ↪️ 📐 part❗️ ▶️ 0 🍇
        🐻 segments part❗️
      🍉
    🍉
    ↩️ segments
  🍉

  📗
    Percent-decode a URL component and turn + into spaces.
    Only ASCII escapes are decoded; multi-byte sequences are left as-is.
  📗
  🐇❗️ 🧹 s 🔡 ➡️ 🔡 🍇
    🔤 !"#$%&'()*+,-./0123456789:;<=>?@ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ[\]^_`abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz{|}~🔤 ➡️ ascii
    🔫 🔄🐇🧰 s 🔤+🔤 🔤 🔤❗️ 🔤%🔤❗️ ➡️ parts
    🆕🔠❗️ ➡️ out
    🐻 out 🐽 parts 0❗️❗️
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 1 📏 parts❓❗️ 🍇
      🐽 parts i❗️ ➡️ part
      👎 ➡️ 🖍🆕decoded
      ↪️ 📐 part❗️ ▶️🙌 2 🍇
        ↪️ 🔢 ✂️🐇🧰 part 0 2❗️ 16❗️ ➡️ code 🍇
          ↪️ code ▶️🙌 32 🤝 code ◀️ 127 🍇
            🐻 out ✂️🐇🧰 ascii code ➖ 32 1❗️❗️
            🐻 out 🦶🐇🧰 part 2❗️❗️
            👍 ➡️ 🖍decoded
          🍉
        🍉
      🍉
      ↪️ ❎ decoded❗️ 🍇
        🐻 out 🔤%🔤❗️
        🐻 out part❗️
      🍉
    🍉
    ↩️ 🔡 out❗️
  🍉
